<title>USA: Kids Mart agrees to private placement.</title>
<headline>Kids Mart agrees to private placement.</headline>
<dateline>CITY OF INDUSTRY, Calif. 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kids Mart Inc said it reached an agreement with a financial advisor and placement agent with respect to a proposed $10 million to $15 million private placement of the company's securities.</p>
</text>
